WEBVTT

00:00.410 --> 00:02.480
You're going to get tens of 
thousands of followers?

00:02.700 --> 00:03.470
That's right.

00:03.470 --> 00:05.270
Before the archons get here.

00:05.460 --> 00:08.520
But we only have 2,000 people 
in this isolation camp.

00:08.770 --> 00:10.430
I have a plan.

00:10.430 --> 00:12.950
Just let them know how sublime I am. Easy!

00:13.190 --> 00:16.880
I'm sorry, but our religion 
has no high culture.

00:16.880 --> 00:17.700
Huh?!

00:17.700 --> 00:20.780
Nor do we have a charismatic 
god or founder.

00:20.780 --> 00:21.840
What about me?!

00:23.020 --> 00:27.860
Which is why I increased our following 
by offering incentives to our believers.

00:27.860 --> 00:30.590
Now we just have to broaden our scope.

00:30.900 --> 00:31.630
Broaden it?

00:33.230 --> 00:33.970
Yes.

00:34.210 --> 00:37.220
To do that, we're going to take 
this village forward in time.

00:38.850 --> 00:40.930
Utilizing her power.

00:44.110 --> 00:46.060
Mitama, we're counting on you.

00:48.030 --> 00:51.790
Yukito... finally believes in me...!

02:23.990 --> 02:29.000
Episode 4
We know we are not worthy
 O great Lord Mitama
 You have aaahhhhh—

02:24.460 --> 02:25.700
We know we are not worthy

02:25.700 --> 02:27.040
O great Lord Mitama

02:27.040 --> 02:29.000
You have aaahhhhh—

02:32.380 --> 02:34.130
This is amazing, Yukito!

02:34.130 --> 02:37.010
Way faster than doing it by hand!

02:37.010 --> 02:39.840
I'll harvest it all!

02:43.810 --> 02:44.880
Wow.

02:44.880 --> 02:46.310
What on earth is that?

02:47.200 --> 02:49.110
That is an instrument of god,

02:49.110 --> 02:50.690
brought forth by Mitama-sama.

02:51.010 --> 02:52.100
Mitama-sama?

02:52.700 --> 02:53.520
That's right.

02:53.520 --> 02:54.860
Mitama-sama.

02:55.410 --> 02:59.700
Those who follow Mitama-sama will 
be allowed to use this godly tool.

02:59.700 --> 03:00.790
I will follow!

03:00.790 --> 03:01.530
Me, too!

03:01.530 --> 03:03.010
I'm first!

03:03.010 --> 03:03.980
I'll follow, too!

03:03.980 --> 03:05.390
Me, too!

03:05.390 --> 03:07.370
Me, too! Me, too! I want to follow!

03:12.010 --> 03:13.570
All right, Mitama-sama.

03:13.570 --> 03:14.990
Cultivators, planting machines,

03:14.990 --> 03:16.810
and combines for them all!

03:16.810 --> 03:19.300
And make sure to give them fuel, too.

03:20.520 --> 03:21.530
All right!

03:21.530 --> 03:23.870
We'll harvest those fields in no time!

03:24.390 --> 03:28.100
My life is being harvested.

03:30.350 --> 03:32.230
I'm good as new!

03:32.230 --> 03:35.940
<b>Followers</b>

03:32.570 --> 03:36.290
It looks like everyone is finally 
becoming aware of my greatness.

03:36.290 --> 03:39.840
They're worshiping the 
farming equipment. Not you.

03:39.840 --> 03:40.450
What?!

03:40.450 --> 03:41.990
I'm lower than a farm tool?

03:43.140 --> 03:45.170
So far, so good...

03:45.990 --> 03:47.150
All right!

03:47.150 --> 03:48.990
With my strengthened god powers,

03:49.390 --> 03:51.420
we can invade the imperial capital!

03:51.420 --> 03:53.370
With around 1,000 followers, 
there's no point.

03:53.650 --> 03:54.760
What's next...?

03:55.330 --> 03:56.460
I'm back!

03:56.790 --> 03:57.900
And one...

03:59.860 --> 04:01.130
And...

04:03.670 --> 04:05.520
Ouch...

04:06.550 --> 04:08.390
I'll have to go draw water again...

04:08.670 --> 04:09.560
<i>That's it.</i>

04:09.960 --> 04:11.640
<i>Water is next!</i>

04:13.260 --> 04:15.810
Oh, wow!

04:16.020 --> 04:18.610
These water works are so convenient!

04:18.890 --> 04:20.610
Water is divine protection from god.

04:20.610 --> 04:23.220
We shall bless each believer's 
home with this protection.

04:24.060 --> 04:27.520
We won't have to make countless 
trips to the well now.

04:27.520 --> 04:29.330
My sister is going to be so happy!

04:30.960 --> 04:32.160
Speaking of Siluril...

04:32.160 --> 04:34.140
Yukito!

04:39.170 --> 04:40.550
Oneechan!

04:40.870 --> 04:45.490
You guys have to put these on, too!

04:56.490 --> 04:57.700
Yukito...

04:57.700 --> 05:00.010
The pool is so amazing.

05:01.850 --> 05:03.320
Oneechan, don't!

05:03.570 --> 05:06.150
You're wearing such a cute bathing suit,

05:06.150 --> 05:08.670
it would be a waste to 
not have Yukito see it!

05:09.210 --> 05:12.620
Yukito-san, what do you think?

05:13.690 --> 05:16.570
I guess you prefer smaller...

05:17.550 --> 05:19.250
I think it looks good on you.

05:20.000 --> 05:21.280
You really think so?

05:22.780 --> 05:25.020
I'm so happy, Oneechan!

05:25.020 --> 05:26.200
I'm happy you're happy, Al!

05:26.200 --> 05:27.100
He said it looks good on me!

05:27.480 --> 05:31.350
<i>Now, I can make you wear even 
more provocative things!</i>

05:28.060 --> 05:29.180
I'm so happy!

05:30.940 --> 05:32.800
Maybe I'll wear this every day.

05:32.560 --> 05:33.790
I can't.

05:33.790 --> 05:36.350
This stimulus is too much for me!

05:39.930 --> 05:42.780
Yu...ki...to...

05:42.780 --> 05:44.650
Oh Mitama, it's you.

05:44.650 --> 05:48.030
You made me pump so much 
underground water and

05:48.030 --> 05:51.140
build plumbing and sewers for 
every follower's house...

05:51.140 --> 05:54.150
I mean, that's my wheelhouse 
since I'm a god of the land...

05:54.150 --> 05:56.540
but I can't anymore...

05:56.870 --> 06:00.540
Oh, you're a god of the land?

06:00.540 --> 06:03.800
How much disinterest can you have in me?!

06:07.630 --> 06:09.430
I'm good as new!

06:09.430 --> 06:10.970
<b>Followers</b>

06:10.970 --> 06:15.520
Now this time it's really time to bring my 
godly hammer of justice down on the empire!

06:15.520 --> 06:17.560
We still don't have enough.

06:17.560 --> 06:21.320
We're still missing something very 
important for a religious organization.

06:21.320 --> 06:22.610
And that is?

06:23.000 --> 06:25.740
We're going to drum up "exclusivity".

06:29.280 --> 06:31.890
Cheers!

06:32.740 --> 06:33.970
This "electricity"

06:33.970 --> 06:38.960
that Yukito and Mitama-sama installed 
in the believers' houses is truly amazing.

06:38.960 --> 06:42.290
Now we can drink deep into the night!

06:43.520 --> 06:44.670
What was that?

06:53.470 --> 06:55.820
Since we're reopening our revamped place...

06:57.090 --> 06:59.560
this is the night time uniform!

07:01.870 --> 07:05.630
Sil's thighs and Al's boobs are the best!

07:05.630 --> 07:06.480
So cute!

07:06.480 --> 07:07.920
So sexy!

07:07.920 --> 07:10.240
Oneechan, I think this is too much...

07:10.820 --> 07:11.890
There, there.

07:11.890 --> 07:14.940
Just think of this as part of the 
"exclusivity" that Yukito talked about.

07:14.940 --> 07:17.300
Tonight, please drink 
to your heart's content!

07:17.300 --> 07:20.000
We are very happy to serve you!

07:21.800 --> 07:23.060
Have a refill.

07:23.060 --> 07:24.670
Listen up, Sil, Al.

07:25.060 --> 07:28.380
Exclusivity is very crucial for 
running a religious organization.

07:29.020 --> 07:33.050
"We are not like the 
others. We are special."

07:33.050 --> 07:37.680
That becomes a very important idea that will 
improve group unity and strengthen their faith.

07:39.040 --> 07:43.100
Everyone, do you have enough to drink?

07:47.770 --> 07:49.820
Sil's butt!

07:52.810 --> 07:54.370
Are you all right, Roy-san?

07:54.830 --> 07:55.880
Roy-san?!

07:56.550 --> 07:58.160
I'm so glad you're all right!

07:58.900 --> 07:59.540
Huh?

08:01.060 --> 08:02.120
Roy-san?

08:08.620 --> 08:10.430
N-No, don't!

08:10.430 --> 08:11.910
C'mon, it's fine!

08:11.910 --> 08:14.300
I mean, look at your outfit.

08:14.300 --> 08:15.590
Oh, yeah!

08:15.590 --> 08:18.800
Let's get more girls and open a new place.

08:18.800 --> 08:20.270
I know it would be popular!

08:20.490 --> 08:24.900
And then Mitama-sama should 
get a new costume as well—

08:29.540 --> 08:33.020
This "electricity" sure is convenient.

08:33.400 --> 08:37.570
Perfect for beating the crap 
out of idiotic customers.

08:42.680 --> 08:46.580
Electricity is one of humanity's 
most important inventions.

08:47.040 --> 08:49.380
Countless lights floating in the darkness.

08:49.380 --> 08:50.690
Thanks to electricity,

08:50.690 --> 08:52.860
mankind was able to conquer the night.

08:57.130 --> 08:58.060
What do you think?

08:58.060 --> 08:59.930
This is exclusivity.

09:04.580 --> 09:07.970
This view is very impressive.

09:08.440 --> 09:13.060
But someone's been dying 
over there for a while.

09:18.340 --> 09:20.890
Don't worry, she'll be back to normal soon.

09:23.810 --> 09:25.500
This sure is something!

09:25.900 --> 09:28.320
Not even the capital has a view like this.

09:28.320 --> 09:29.510
As far as lights at night,

09:29.510 --> 09:32.000
the most they can do is oil lanterns.

09:32.000 --> 09:35.260
I bet not even the Emperor 
has seen a view like this.

09:35.500 --> 09:39.930
How do you know that the Emperor 
doesn't know about such lights?

09:41.540 --> 09:43.140
You sure know a lot about the capital

09:43.140 --> 09:44.980
for someone who lives in an isolation camp.

09:46.480 --> 09:47.310
Clen?

09:47.680 --> 09:48.540
Yeah...

09:49.280 --> 09:50.930
I should've said something.

09:51.370 --> 09:54.570
I used to do work for the Imperial Palace.

09:56.120 --> 09:57.090
The Imperial Palace?

09:58.950 --> 10:02.200
So you were sent here despite 
having maintained such a lofty position?

10:02.200 --> 10:03.050
No.

10:09.310 --> 10:10.460
Wh-What?

10:10.980 --> 10:13.750
You don't have the isolation camp's brand.

10:15.020 --> 10:18.720
I live in this village of my own volition.

10:19.480 --> 10:23.220
This life suits me better 
than being in the capital.

10:25.070 --> 10:26.020
I see.

10:26.550 --> 10:28.540
I guess there are people like that, too.

10:30.620 --> 10:31.720
What is it, Mitama?

10:31.720 --> 10:32.800
Nothing.

10:32.800 --> 10:35.320
I was just thinking about how many 
different types of humans there are.

10:35.320 --> 10:36.700
That's right.

10:36.700 --> 10:38.880
I'm aware of my own eccentricity.

10:38.880 --> 10:44.160
Though I think you're much 
stranger than any of us, Mitama-chan.

10:44.460 --> 10:50.440
I've become interested in this 
"god" you sometimes speak of.

10:52.000 --> 10:53.820
Could you explain it to me, Yukito?

10:55.110 --> 10:59.090
What, exactly, is this "god" 
thing you refer to?

10:59.450 --> 11:00.660
God, huh?

11:01.510 --> 11:03.840
I think where I came from,

11:03.840 --> 11:05.140
there were two types of gods,

11:05.140 --> 11:07.020
though I am not an expert.

11:07.350 --> 11:12.110
One was used as an entity to 
explain inexplicable events.

11:12.790 --> 11:16.610
The other was a symbol 
created by religions.

11:17.020 --> 11:19.540
You not having the latter 
is not particularly strange.

11:19.540 --> 11:22.200
But it's strange that 
you don't have the first.

11:22.390 --> 11:25.910
That would mean that there are no 
"inexplicable events" in this land.

11:27.920 --> 11:29.630
I don't quite get it,

11:29.630 --> 11:32.290
but I guess that would 
make the Emperor god.

11:33.940 --> 11:38.490
Natural phenomena, disasters, 
illness, and strange beasts...

11:38.490 --> 11:41.340
Those are all explained by the assembly 
that works directly under the Emperor.

11:41.840 --> 11:42.850
All of it?

11:43.480 --> 11:45.120
As long as that assembly exists,

11:45.120 --> 11:47.390
there is nothing that we cannot understand.

11:48.450 --> 11:52.980
What the hell is this country's Emperor...?

11:55.090 --> 11:57.200
We broke 2,000 followers!

11:57.200 --> 11:59.480
My power is overflowing!

11:59.480 --> 12:01.700
<b>Followers</b>

11:59.800 --> 12:04.000
With this, we've made practically every 
single person in this village a follower.

12:04.000 --> 12:06.370
But this was just the preparation step.

12:06.570 --> 12:08.030
The next steps...

12:10.510 --> 12:11.580
Bad news!

12:11.580 --> 12:16.130
Bertrand's been captured and 
beaten up by a little girl!

12:16.650 --> 12:20.180
Are little girls their 
weak point or something?

12:21.520 --> 12:23.090
This is water?

12:23.090 --> 12:24.880
I don't understand the principle behind it,

12:24.880 --> 12:27.510
but I'm sure the Emperor would know.

12:27.810 --> 12:33.280
But there's no way the people of the isolation 
camp could have created something like this.

12:33.280 --> 12:35.980
There must be some outsider 
who is directing them.

12:36.480 --> 12:37.980
So I will ask you again.

12:38.480 --> 12:40.990
Who is manipulating this isolation camp?

12:40.990 --> 12:42.620
Where are they?

12:44.840 --> 12:47.410
Are you communicating this to the assembly?

12:47.410 --> 12:50.200
This was something we just did on our own.

12:50.530 --> 12:51.750
On your own?

12:54.990 --> 12:56.650
This is none of your business.

12:57.770 --> 12:59.920
The assembly's decisions are absolute.

12:59.920 --> 13:03.110
No one is permitted to act 
without authorization.

13:04.560 --> 13:05.430
What is it?

13:05.430 --> 13:07.440
<i>What's your status?</i>

13:07.440 --> 13:09.870
I am looking into that isolation camp.

13:09.870 --> 13:12.390
They are controlling strange 
beasts I've never seen before

13:12.390 --> 13:14.180
and using very odd tools.

13:14.430 --> 13:16.790
Did you know about this, Loki?

13:16.790 --> 13:18.610
<i>I did not.</i>

13:18.830 --> 13:23.090
<i>The only ones who could do that 
are the Emperor or archons.</i>

13:23.090 --> 13:27.910
<i>Or someone who has archon-like 
powers betrayed us.</i>

13:28.560 --> 13:30.240
You are well aware, right?

13:30.470 --> 13:31.690
In the past,

13:31.690 --> 13:34.400
there was an archon who went 
against the will of our liege.

13:34.900 --> 13:39.660
Talking about friends, companions, 
family, and other nonsensical things.

13:39.660 --> 13:41.630
What should be done with people like that?

13:42.040 --> 13:43.000
Purge them.

13:43.230 --> 13:44.550
That's right.

13:44.950 --> 13:47.280
You're not like her.

13:47.280 --> 13:49.510
Just raze the entire isolation camp.

13:50.110 --> 13:52.100
That's an order from the Emperor.

13:52.370 --> 13:53.390
That's right.

13:53.390 --> 13:56.730
Any threat to the empire must 
be proactively eliminated.

13:57.280 --> 13:59.980
I told you I'd take you 
back to the capital.

14:00.250 --> 14:03.280
But if you have no intention 
of talking at all,

14:04.640 --> 14:07.500
I don't mind blowing off 
one or two of your limbs.

14:16.400 --> 14:18.210
That's enough!

14:23.310 --> 14:24.420
Who are you?

14:24.720 --> 14:26.480
I am a god.

14:27.910 --> 14:28.710
God?

14:29.090 --> 14:30.730
My followers are my family.

14:30.730 --> 14:33.190
It is a god's duty to 
protect their followers.

14:33.190 --> 14:34.680
That's what Yukito said.

14:36.720 --> 14:37.820
Family?

14:38.280 --> 14:39.440
Ridiculous.

14:39.440 --> 14:43.520
I will destroy anyone who goes 
against the will of the assembly.

14:43.770 --> 14:45.600
Foolish human.

14:45.600 --> 14:49.950
Time for you to witness the 
power of an omnipotent god.

14:50.400 --> 14:51.980
Hey, Bertrand!

14:51.980 --> 14:52.740
Are you all right?

14:53.650 --> 14:55.550
Yuki...to...

14:56.300 --> 14:57.870
Who the hell is that?

14:58.330 --> 15:00.670
They're an archon.

15:01.320 --> 15:03.590
They've come to wipe out this village.

15:05.220 --> 15:08.740
This isolation camp is in 
violation of the assembly's will.

15:08.740 --> 15:10.250
Soon, it will be returned to its former—

15:10.250 --> 15:12.580
It's time I showed you, puny human.

15:12.580 --> 15:15.100
In this world, as God, I make the rules!

15:18.420 --> 15:19.250
I see.

15:20.650 --> 15:21.270
In that case...

15:27.260 --> 15:28.650
You foolish child.

15:28.890 --> 15:31.910
It is the Emperor who decides all rules.

15:41.140 --> 15:42.430
Like I said.

15:42.430 --> 15:44.670
I am the rules.

15:44.920 --> 15:47.310
Was that a... beam?

15:47.770 --> 15:49.800
That's the power of an archon's weapon.

15:50.400 --> 15:51.520
A boulder?

15:51.520 --> 15:55.600
No, a mere boulder could never 
withstand the power of this weapon.

15:56.770 --> 15:58.080
Now...

16:05.360 --> 16:06.960
Kneel!

16:12.070 --> 16:12.850
<i>What is this?</i>

16:12.850 --> 16:13.910
<i>Some sort of plant-based monster?</i>

16:13.910 --> 16:15.520
I can't believe this.

16:15.520 --> 16:18.330
She's able to fight head-to-head
against that archon!

16:20.660 --> 16:23.000
I'm not done yet, little girl!

16:23.000 --> 16:25.160
<i>They look evenly matched right now,</i>

16:25.160 --> 16:27.960
<i>but Mitama only has about 2,000 followers.</i>

16:47.860 --> 16:49.870
Here comes the coup de grâce!

16:59.740 --> 17:01.370
Did I do it?

17:01.370 --> 17:02.960
Yukito!

17:02.960 --> 17:03.700
Idiot!

17:03.700 --> 17:06.460
Why would you do something 
so obviously foreboding?

17:12.000 --> 17:12.840
Damn it.

17:13.330 --> 17:15.630
Guess that wasn't all they had.

17:19.870 --> 17:20.780
What is...

17:23.780 --> 17:24.880
that...?!

17:28.280 --> 17:30.190
You're tough!

17:30.750 --> 17:32.400
<i>I used too much of my power.</i>

17:32.400 --> 17:33.780
<i>I need to end it with this!</i>

17:39.370 --> 17:42.370
Go!

17:50.980 --> 17:52.250
<i>That form...</i>

17:52.530 --> 17:54.090
That power...

17:54.950 --> 17:59.510
I wanted to avoid using this power 
within the territory of the empire,

17:59.510 --> 18:00.640
but I have no choice.

18:00.950 --> 18:02.260
<i>It's totally...</i>

18:04.270 --> 18:06.100
I will wipe out this isolation camp.

18:06.550 --> 18:08.770
<i>...something from a legend.</i>

18:11.830 --> 18:14.570
Is it all right for us to be here?

18:14.960 --> 18:17.070
Yukito told us to not go outside.

18:17.070 --> 18:18.660
We don't have a choice.

18:19.040 --> 18:20.030
But...!

18:20.030 --> 18:23.790
Even if we go outside, 
there's nothing we can do.

18:24.300 --> 18:28.320
All we can do now is believe in 
Yukito and Mitama-chan and wait.

18:28.320 --> 18:31.760
But they're fighting for 
our village right now.

18:31.760 --> 18:33.750
Even if there's nothing I can do,

18:34.240 --> 18:36.050
I want to be there with them.

18:36.910 --> 18:38.050
Al, wait!

18:38.050 --> 18:38.840
Stop!

18:39.210 --> 18:40.260
Al!

18:41.180 --> 18:41.990
Al!

18:41.990 --> 18:43.110
Sil!

18:44.320 --> 18:46.580
Huh? Hey, Clen! Hey!

18:46.580 --> 18:47.940
Not you, too!

18:49.140 --> 18:50.040
Damn it!

18:50.830 --> 18:51.650
R-Roy!

18:54.230 --> 18:57.430
<i>Wh-Wh-Wh-What do I do?!</i>

18:57.430 --> 18:59.070
<i>No more power left...</i>

18:59.070 --> 19:00.910
<i>That little girl?</i>

19:01.360 --> 19:03.270
<i>That little girl?</i>

19:03.270 --> 19:05.580
<i>I'm going to lose to that little girl?</i>

19:05.780 --> 19:07.870
<i>To that little brat?!</i>

19:08.730 --> 19:09.770
Mitama!

19:10.820 --> 19:11.580
Please.

19:12.550 --> 19:14.380
You're our only hope!

19:16.420 --> 19:19.280
I've regained a little power.

19:19.280 --> 19:21.720
It's annoying that I have to 
borrow some of their power,

19:22.220 --> 19:24.870
but Yukito is counting on me!

19:25.820 --> 19:28.600
Calling on all gods!

19:33.350 --> 19:35.630
These are all the deities!

19:35.630 --> 19:37.660
As a primordial god,

19:37.660 --> 19:40.400
all the gods and their 
weapons are at my disposal!

19:40.400 --> 19:44.120
Have a taste of that power!

20:00.550 --> 20:01.130
What?

20:01.130 --> 20:02.760
You're leaving already?

20:02.990 --> 20:04.390
W-Wait!

20:04.700 --> 20:07.590
You're kidding! Right now?!

20:08.100 --> 20:09.900
Everyone, wait!

20:10.560 --> 20:15.190
But we're just getting started!

20:15.690 --> 20:20.440
<i>They saw how many followers 
I have and left.</i>

20:35.940 --> 20:38.420
Mitama?! Are you all right?!

20:39.440 --> 20:41.210
I'm sorry, Yukito.

20:42.450 --> 20:47.030
I couldn't help you.

20:49.170 --> 20:50.640
Hang in there.

20:51.680 --> 20:53.430
What the hell is she?

20:53.430 --> 20:54.730
What the hell are those weapons?

20:55.240 --> 20:57.060
What the hell is this world?!

20:57.820 --> 20:59.340
Yukito-san!

20:59.340 --> 21:00.530
Mitama-chan!

21:01.090 --> 21:03.320
Why are you guys here?

21:03.320 --> 21:07.460
Al said she didn't want to leave 
your side even for a moment.

21:07.460 --> 21:08.870
Hey, come on!

21:08.870 --> 21:10.820
That's not what I said!

21:11.570 --> 21:13.750
Mitama-chan, are you okay?

21:14.320 --> 21:18.460
Hey, hey, hey, who's that 
nearly naked girl up there?

21:18.460 --> 21:20.550
How come she's just floating in space?

21:20.550 --> 21:22.590
What am I being rewarded for?

21:22.590 --> 21:24.520
<i>What are they?</i>

21:25.760 --> 21:27.510
<i>It's almost inexplicable...</i>

21:28.550 --> 21:30.760
<i>What... are they?!</i>

21:32.400 --> 21:34.020
Yukito, this is bad!

21:34.270 --> 21:36.250
She's going to— The village...

21:36.250 --> 21:37.730
Yukito-san!

21:38.150 --> 21:39.610
Ridiculous.

21:41.200 --> 21:42.400
Ridiculous.

21:42.690 --> 21:44.070
Ridiculous!

21:44.070 --> 21:45.400
Ridiculous!

21:45.820 --> 21:47.460
Ridiculous!

21:52.900 --> 21:56.410
With this, my mission is complete.

21:57.260 --> 21:58.420
<i>Oh.</i>

21:58.830 --> 22:02.630
<i>I guess I'm going to let them die again...</i>

22:03.430 --> 22:07.010
<i>In the end, I couldn't 
change a single thing.</i>

22:07.380 --> 22:10.040
<i>Here I was thinking that this time, 
it would actually go right.</i>

22:17.400 --> 22:18.520
What the...

22:19.070 --> 22:20.610
What just happened?

22:23.360 --> 22:25.230
Could I have missed?

22:25.920 --> 22:27.070
This was an illusion?

22:27.070 --> 22:28.040
Then, that means...

22:29.060 --> 22:31.530
That's enough, Atar.

22:31.950 --> 22:32.910
Loki.

22:33.150 --> 22:35.800
I didn't recognize you in that form.

22:35.800 --> 22:39.420
You're getting a little slow if 
you didn't figure out it's me.

22:41.120 --> 22:43.530
Clen. You're...

22:44.300 --> 22:45.740
That's right.

22:47.110 --> 22:50.340
There never was a man called Clen.

22:51.930 --> 22:55.840
You all treated me like 
you'd known me for ages.

22:55.840 --> 22:57.120
So it's been fun.

23:00.920 --> 23:02.380
My name is Loki.

23:04.770 --> 23:07.070
I'm one of the main archons.

23:08.320 --> 23:09.360
An archon?!

23:09.920 --> 23:10.540
So all this time,

23:10.540 --> 23:13.200
you had infiltrated the villagers 
and had been monitoring them?

23:13.700 --> 23:15.990
Why did you get in my way, Loki?

23:16.970 --> 23:18.790
Depending on how you answer, I may...

23:22.320 --> 23:23.220
Yukito.

23:23.980 --> 23:25.000
Mitama-chan.

23:26.100 --> 23:27.630
The time is ripe.

23:28.470 --> 23:32.990
Let's go assassinate the 
Emperor of this country.

23:35.010 --> 23:40.020
Episode 5
We know we are not worthy
O great Lord Mitama
You created all things—

23:35.430 --> 23:36.790
We know we are not worthy

23:36.790 --> 23:37.880
O great Lord Mitama

23:37.880 --> 23:40.020
You created all things—
